  &lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="color: #5a5a5a; margin-top: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.6em !important;"&gt;Grace Snow&lt;/span&gt; 
  &lt;/p&gt;
